# caption: Finish the case-study relocatable object only after all consistency checks succeed.

REQUIRE section buffers, symbol entries, and stable-identifier fixups
ENSURE a self-consistent ELF64 ET_REL file
reject unresolved names lacking permitted external binding
build string tables and local-first symbol serialization
translate every fixup's target to its final ELF symbol index
append aligned section payloads, excluding NOBITS contents
append relocation and symbol/string payloads
append section headers containing the recorded offsets and links
complete the ELF header with section-table location and sizes
publish the complete file

